File Index

/add-hosts.ps1
Purpose: This PowerShell script automatically updates the system hosts file to map local domain names to localhost for development purposes.

/add-hosts.sh
Purpose: This script modifies the system hosts file to map local domain names for a development environment.

/firewall-open-ports.ps1
Purpose: Opens specified network ports in Windows firewall for a project based on environment mode.

/firewall-open-ports.sh
Purpose: Opens specified network ports for a project based on environment mode using available firewall tools.

/mkcert-init.sh
Purpose: Initializes local development SSL certificates for the shatteredarchive project.

/remove-hosts.ps1
Purpose: Removes ShatteredArchive entries from the system hosts file.

/remove-hosts.sh
Purpose: Removes ShatteredArchive entries from the system hosts file.

/setup-certs.ps1
Purpose: Generates the local dev TLS cert via mkcert into deploy/nginx/certs — apex + *.shatteredarchive.dev wildcard so every one-level subdomain is covered.

/setup-certs.sh
Purpose: Bash twin of setup-certs.ps1 — same apex + wildcard cert into deploy/nginx/certs (the dir nginx mounts).
